{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:de7d0e90844366fd","name":"Gand Weapon Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-de7d0e90844366fd","title":"Gand Weapon Template","revision":19144,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:24:09Z","sha256":"69a52c4b49591e5072fab7146d4a0f18963b4bb22b98511d52fb840eebfe3859","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19144","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gand%20Weapon%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-de7d0e90844366fd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10% or 1,000 credits (whichever is higher) more than the base item\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," Weapons (with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gand","referenceId":"reference:b1e03f0020e00311"},", peculiar and often incomprehensible, specialize in crafting weapons that immobilize opponents.  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," If a Gand Weapon moves a target down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage, that target has its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," halved until it returns to its normal state (all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conditions","referenceId":"reference:97d4be8960698f97"}," removed); a target that is -4 steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," (at the -10 step) is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilized"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilized"}," instead. Gand Weapons are difficult to operate, and all Gand Weapons are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons"}," for purposes of proficiency (except to a member of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gand","referenceId":"reference:b1e03f0020e00311"}," Species).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
